        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Disposal, heat pump, air-water, 7kW
Inventory for the disposal of an air-water heat pump, 7kW.;
UUID: 6d8abbac-2a52-498f-9081-9d8f9500a6a5
Disposal of the air-water heat pump (256 kg). Transport to WEEE dismantling facilities, machines for handling in sorting plant, electricity demand for sorting plant, final disposal of waste material. Cut-off to recycling for metals.
Location: Data apply to the supply in Switzerland.
Technology: average technology available on market
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: &lt;null&gt;
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_6d8abbac-2a52-498f-9081-9d8f9500a6a5.xml</text>
